{"id":"podumat_","lemma":"подумать","pos":"verb","rank":484,"glosses":["to think (for a while), to have a think, to consider, to reflect, to ponder","to arrive at a thought, to conclude, to figure","to decide, to think (to do something), to arrive at an idea (with a verb in the infinitive)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f6/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4%D1%83%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4%D1%83%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"подумаю","2s":"подумаешь","3s":"подумает","1p":"подумаем","2p":"подумаете","3p":"подумают"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"подумай","2p":"подумайте"}}},"past":{"m":"подумал","p":"подумали","f":"подумала","n":"подумало"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"думать","examples":[{"text":"Что ты подумал?","en":"What did you think?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Что подумала бы твоя мать?","en":"What would your mother think?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"would"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},{"g":"mother"}]},{"text":"Что бы подумал твой отец?","en":"What would your father think?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"would"},null,{"g":"your"},{"g":"father"}]},{"text":"Дайте мне немного времени подумать.","en":"Give me some time to think.","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"дать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"a little, some"},{"g":"time","l":"время"},null]},{"text":"Подумай обо мне.","en":"Think about me.","words":[null,null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"}]}]}